# Keep local secrets, data and unrelated toolchains out of the image build
# context (Dockerfile). Railway builds from a clean git checkout, where most
# of these don't exist — this also protects a local `docker build`.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
build/
.pytest_cache/
data/
content/
evaluation/
web/
tests/
docs/
*.backup
